Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.5.0 merges the window/view-tree dumps and pref-driven per-process targets with the SpringBoard recon mode (icon inventory, pixel signatures, hook-free hosting-view scan), and reports layer-level colour so an artwork-derived background can be located. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks

